               "💡 Study Tips: How to study effectively, memory techniques\n" +
               "📝 Exam Preparation: Test strategies, anxiety reduction\n\n" +
               "Just ask me any question about these subjects!\n" +
               "Examples: 'What is algebra?', 'Study tips', 'Exam preparation'";
    }
    
    /**
